@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

state "Create Account" as CreateAccount
CreateAccount : entry / User starts creating account
CreateAccount : do / Fill details and submit
CreateAccount : exit / Account created successfully

state "Watch Videos" as WatchVideos
WatchVideos : entry / User logged in
WatchVideos : do / Watch videos
WatchVideos : exit / Video watched

state "Upload Videos" as UploadVideos
UploadVideos : entry / User logged in
UploadVideos : do / Upload video
UploadVideos : exit / Video uploaded

state "Save to Likes List" as SaveToLikesList
SaveToLikesList : entry / User watching videos
SaveToLikesList : do / Add video to likes list
SaveToLikesList : exit / Video saved

state "View Likes List" as ViewLikesList
ViewLikesList : entry / User logged in
ViewLikesList : do / View saved videos
ViewLikesList : exit / Videos viewed

state "Enter Discussion Option" as EnterDiscussionOption
EnterDiscussionOption : entry / User watching videos
EnterDiscussionOption : do / Enter discussion option
EnterDiscussionOption : exit / Discussion entered

[*] --> CreateAccount

CreateAccount --> WatchVideos : [Logged in]
WatchVideos --> UploadVideos : [Logged in]
UploadVideos --> SaveToLikesList : [Logged in]
SaveToLikesList --> ViewLikesList : [Logged in]
ViewLikesList --> EnterDiscussionOption : [Logged in]

@enduml
